        <mxCell id="EbJxW3jv7QS7McjEMLKu-524" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Linux v2.0&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;Kernel version 2.0 is released. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It can now serve several processors at the same time using &lt;i&gt;symmetric multiprocessing &lt;/i&gt;(SMP), becoming a serious alternative for many companies.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;textShadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
