        <mxCell id="EbJxW3jv7QS7McjEMLKu-609" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;The X11 window system&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;A team of developers joins forces with the standard &lt;b&gt;X&lt;/b&gt; body to create the &lt;b&gt;X.Org Foundation&lt;/b&gt;, a non-profit corporation chartered to research, develop, support, organize, administrate, standardize, promote and defend a free and open accelerated graphics stack.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The &lt;b&gt;X.Org Server&lt;/b&gt;, an open-source implementation of the X Window System (&lt;b&gt;X11&lt;/b&gt;) display server, is released. &lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X.Org_Server&quot;&gt;[23]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;textShadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1359.58" y="917.63" width="160.42" height="282.37" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
